---
title: Garlic Bread
image: https://cookingwithcurls.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Easy-Garlic-Bread-Recipe-2-cookingwithcurls.com_.jpg
servings: 4
cuisine: Italian
time required: 20 minutes
---

Preheat oven to 425° F.

Line a #baking sheet{} with foil and place @bread slices{to desired quantity}(preferably french loaf).

Using a #brush, spread @butter{4%tbsp}(melted, unsalted) on each slice. Season with @garlic powder{}(to taste), @italian seasoning{}(to taste), @onion powder{}(to taste), and @?parsley{}(to taste).

Flip over the slices and repeat on the other side. You don't need as much on this side, just enough to coat and for consistency.

Bake in the oven for ~{10-15%minutes} or until slightly golden brown on the edges. If you want, add @?shredded cheese{} during the last 2-ish minutes of baking.